Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: picam-recorder
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, aipicam-config
Description: picam-raw stream recorder with pre/post buffer
 Records picam-raw's raw YUV420 UDP stream to H.264 MP4 files with
 configurable pre-roll and post-roll buffers, via a JPEG-captured
 intermediate transcoded to H.264 after each recording finishes.
 Controlled via a TCP plain-text protocol. Writes an MP4 and CSV
 metadata sidecar per recording.
